WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:05.078
Boom! Boom! The scarecrow was still firing corn kernels at Roxy.

2
00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:07.012
"Ouch!" she cried.

3
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:10.853
"These tiny things hurt! I'll try my heat vision on them!"

4
00:00:10.854 --> 00:00:14.343
Roxy shot hot, orange beams at the corn kernels.

5
00:00:14.344 --> 00:00:19.006
Pop! Pop! Pop! The kernels burst into popcorn.

6
00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:23.110
Roxy laughed as a few kernels flew into her mouth.

7
00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:25.475
"Yum!" she shouted.

8
00:00:25.476 --> 00:00:28.023
Roxy zoomed closer to Billy's plane.

9
00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:30.617
"Got any butter and salt, Billy?"

10
00:00:30.618 --> 00:00:33.991
"No, Rocket Girl," Billy yelled back.

11
00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:39.497
"But we've got plenty more ways to stop you!"

12
00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:42.486
A scarecrow leaned out and swung a pitchfork at her.

13
00:00:42.487 --> 00:00:44.075
Roxy dodged it.

14
00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:46.643
The scarecrow swung the pitchfork again.

15
00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:49.986
This time Roxy grabbed it, and then she let go.

16
00:00:49.987 --> 00:00:52.846
The scarecrow teetered and lost its balance.

17
00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:57.354
It fell backward—and out of the plane!

18
00:00:57.355 --> 00:01:01.988
"Hee-haw!" Billy shook his fist in anger.

19
00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:05.488
"You can't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

20
00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:07.320
The plane flew higher.

21
00:01:07.321 --> 00:01:10.319
Roxy shot after it until she was in front of it.

22
00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:15.947
Then she grabbed the propeller and yanked it off.

23
00:01:15.948 --> 00:01:18.711
"Gosh darn it!" Billy yelled.

24
00:01:18.712 --> 00:01:21.375
"My grandpa's airplane!

25
00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:24.211
You broke it, Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:24.212 --> 00:01:27.696
The airplane started falling fast.

27
00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:31.749
The scarecrows waved to Billy and jumped out.

28
00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.382
"Cowards!" Billy yelled.

29
00:01:34.383 --> 00:01:39.613
"Come back here and help me fight!" The

30
00:01:39.614 --> 00:01:41.509
plane was about to crash. Roxy

31
00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.692
flew under it and caught it just in time. She

32
00:01:44.693 --> 00:01:48.909
placed the plane on the softball field. "Ugh."

33
00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:51.753
Barnyard Billy hung his head. "You

34
00:01:51.754 --> 00:01:55.836
ruined everything, Rocket Girl." "Yep!"

35
00:01:55.837 --> 00:02:00.477
Roxy grinned. "You're going to jail." With

36
00:02:00.478 --> 00:02:05.668
her super breath, she started clearing away the corn. "Rocket

37
00:02:05.669 --> 00:02:09.333
Girl, wait!" a softball player yelled. "Can

38
00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:13.306
you make popcorn for us before you take him away?" "Sure,"

39
00:02:13.307 --> 00:02:15.909
Roxy said. With

40
00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:24.554
her heat vision, she popped some corn kernels. Pop! Pop! Pop! Then

41
00:02:24.555 --> 00:02:32.389
she picked up Billy and flew to Police Headquarters. ***

42
00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.425
Soon Roxy was back at the softball field.

43
00:02:35.426 --> 00:02:38.467
The players were still eating popcorn.

44
00:02:38.468 --> 00:02:42.381
"Hey, guys!" Roxy said. "What did I miss?"

45
00:02:42.382 --> 00:02:45.596
Roxy's friends started talking at once.

46
00:02:45.597 --> 00:02:49.626
"You missed some strange scarecrows!" Mara said.

47
00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:54.568
Jack nodded. "And a crazy farmer who tried to plant corn everywhere!"

48
00:02:54.569 --> 00:02:57.133
"Yep." Terrell grinned at Roxy.

49
00:02:57.134 --> 00:03:00.230
"But luckily Rocket Girl stopped him."

50
00:03:00.231 --> 00:03:04.896
"Sounds like I missed some pretty exciting stuff," Roxy said.

51
00:03:04.897 --> 00:03:07.854
"You did," Jack said.

52
00:03:07.855 --> 00:03:10.511
"But we saved some popcorn for you."

53
00:03:10.512 --> 00:03:14.764
"Um . . ." Roxy looked at the popcorn and made a face.

54
00:03:14.765 --> 00:03:20.915
"No thanks. I think I've had enough corn for today!"

